  "description": "Our Cale SX Eagle model uses our lightweight triple-butted aluminium Cale frame with its multitude of mounts, and pairs it with an air-sprung RockShox 35 Gold RL fork which offers compression and rebound adjustment. SRAM’s SX Eagle drivetrain with its 11 - 50T cassette and a 30T chainring help out when things get really tough. Seido’s 40 mm stem and 800 mm wide bar with a KS 150 mm dropper post and SRAM Level brakes provide excellent control when the trail turns gnarly. Wheels are tubeless ready WTB i29 rims, Bombtrack hubs and Kenda Hellcat Pro 2.4’’ tyres. Time to hit the woods.",
